{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16008","headline":"铜雀台 · 王建","name":"铜雀台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"娇爱更何日，高台空数层。\n含啼暎双袖，不忍看西陵。\n漳水东流无复来，百花辇路爲苍苔。\n青楼月夜长寂寞，碧云日莫空裴回。\n君不见邺中万事非昔时，古人不在今人悲。\n春风不逐君王去，草色年年旧宫路。\n宫中歌舞已浮云，空指行日往来处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}